        <p style="color:#FFFFFF;font-size:0.88rem;line-height:1.8;">Our fit testing methodology uses professional fit models representing your target customer demographic. We evaluate garments on measurement forms and live models, assessing ease, balance, proportion, and movement. We document fit issues with photos and measurements, then create pattern corrections. Multiple fit rounds ensure the final fit meets your standards.</p>
