      </div>
      <div style="border-bottom:1px solid #e00;padding:1.5rem 0;">
        <h3 style="font-size:1rem;font-weight:500;color:#fff;margin-bottom:0.75rem;">Do you specialize in plus size fit?</h3>
        <p style="color:#FFFFFF;font-size:0.88rem;line-height:1.8;">Yes. Plus size fit requires specialized pattern work beyond simple grading. We have plus size fit models and develop patterns specifically for larger body types, accounting for different body proportions, weight distribution, and ease requirements. Our plus size engineering ensures garments fit comfortably and flatteringly across extended size ranges.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="padding:1.5rem 0;">
        <h3 style="font-size:1rem;font-weight:500;color:#fff;margin-bottom:0.75rem;">How do you ensure fit consistency across reorders?</h3>
