      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- CTA Section -->
<section style="padding:5rem 0;border-bottom:1px solid #e00;">
  <div class="container">
    <p style="color:#FFFFFF;max-width:800px;line-height:1.8;font-size:0.95rem;">
      Need professional fit engineering for your brand? <a href="/contact" style="color:#e00;text-decoration:underline;">Contact SDF Clothing here</a> with your fit requirements | target customer profile, size range, and any current fit issues. We will provide a fit development plan, timeline, and pricing within 48 hours. Free consultation.
